\" width=\"1142\" height=\"440\" /></p>\n<p>許可權 – 歡迎您將其用於自己的整合包中。</p>\n<p>點擊下方橫幅立即獲取您的服務器！或者訪問<a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\">BisectHosting.com</a>&nbsp;並確保使用代碼'<strong>gamerpotion</strong>'享受75折優惠。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/608/745/bisect-banner-large3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"415\" /></a></p>",
